# Build output. Nothing generated belongs in this repo — it is a registry, not an artifact store.
#
# The emulator is deliberately NOT listed here. It used to be staged in .emu/, and a gitignore rule
# meant a hand-copied local build could sit there indefinitely without showing up in `git status`,
# disagreeing with the deployed one that CI uses. tools/fetch-emu.mjs now resolves it into the OS
# cache dir instead, so there is no in-repo path to place one into — and if someone does, it is
# visible.
out/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
